{"unit_id":"DreamRift__dsh-vision-bridge#card-zh","repo":"DreamRift/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"a9501e68ee8aeb7187034e78e6ae9f3fc2f4ba56","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-bridge 是面向 DSH Web 的视觉模型桥接插件：它在 LLM 请求中把图片内容转换为文字描述，使不支持图片输入的文本模型也能处理截图和照片。插件可按路由代理图片、注册本地图片问答与 OCR 工具，并对原生支持图片的模型自动直通。设置页支持调整视觉端点、模型和密钥；默认通过 DashScope 兼容接口处理图像。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh/index.js:4-16","src/dsh/config.js:12-20","src/dsh/tools.js:117-151"]}
{"unit_id":"DreamRift__dsh-vision-bridge#card-en","repo":"DreamRift/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"a9501e68ee8aeb7187034e78e6ae9f3fc2f4ba56","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vision-bridge helps DSH Web text models process images by turning image blocks into descriptions. It provides local image question answering and OCR tools, and lets native multimodal routes pass through. Configure the vision endpoint, model, and credential reference in settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh/index.js:4-16","src/dsh/config.js:12-20","src/dsh/tools.js:117-151"]}
